          "quote": "我有点乱，想问现在算不算危险，药是不是已经用对了？"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00092",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides a short prioritized bedside checklist: do not self-adjust oxygen/drugs, ask the receiving doctor about key results, and focus on a few core observations instead of all details.",
          "quote": "我今晚就按您说的守着：氧气不碰，不自己扶他起来试走，老人烦也劝他戴着；家里人要是再问，我就说“今晚继续住院吸氧观察，明早医生复评，别催出院”。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00125",
          "explanation": "Family confirms the checklist is usable and that they will act on it, not just passively receive information.",
          "quote": "我把您补充的也记住了：除了喘得厉害、发紫、胸痛咳血、叫不醒、突然烦躁这些，如果出现出冷汗、脸色白、手脚凉，或者我直觉觉得他明显不对劲，就马上按铃喊护士。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The family surfaces practical constraints (holding only a few papers, confusion during chaotic transfer). The doctor creates a short prioritized checklist focused on transfer safety and key questions for the receiving team, and the family confirms they can execute it and will not self-adjust medications.",
